WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.850
Lab 1 runs on a laptop with no tenant.

2
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:08.837
Step one lists the configuration read: five
calls, under exactly three permissions.

3
00:00:08.837 --> 00:00:11.563
Step two measures the fixture CRLs.

4
00:00:11.563 --> 00:00:14.962
Two are read, with their sizes;
the third file is missing,

5
00:00:14.962 --> 00:00:18.287
and that's recorded with its
error rather than raised.

6
00:00:18.287 --> 00:00:19.600
Your times will differ.

7
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.607
The check in the next step
reads a different file,

8
00:00:22.607 --> 00:00:26.741
the fictional tenant's own
measurements, where one CRL is eighteen

9
00:00:26.741 --> 00:00:30.480
and a half million bytes and
took eleven point four seconds.
